OL,3,GNEWSAFunnel cloud over Hadrian's Wall
OL,4,Acaught on camera
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tornado-like cloud spotted in the sky
OL,7,Fover Northumberland has caused
OL,8,Fexcitement for a weather-watching
OL,9,Ffamily.
OL,11,FJazmin Gray had been getting ready to
OL,12,Fgo out on a dog walk with her family
OL,13,Fnear Bardon Mill on Sunday at about
OL,14,F13:30 GMT.
OL,16,F"My husband came in and said 'there's a
OL,17,Ftornado out the back'," she said. "We
OL,18,Fall just jumped up out the living room
OL,19,Fand went into the kitchen."
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
