OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFunnel cloud over Hadrian's Wall
OL,4,Acaught on camera
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat the family saw was not a tornado,
OL,7,Fbut a funnel cloud. These form around
OL,8,Flocalised areas of intensely low
OL,9,Fpressure, in the same way as tornadoes,
OL,10,Fbut are only classed as such if they
OL,11,Ftouch the ground.
